name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I paid Harbor Logistics's approved invoice once, by wire, from the operating account.\n\n- **Payment:** PAY0001, status \"sent\"\n- **Invoice:** INV-75453\n- **Amount:** $4,339.68, the full invoice amount\n- **Due date:** 2026-11-04\n\n**Checks before paying:**\n- This was the only approved Harbor Logistics invoice. Of the other two, INV-10981 is still a draft awaiting approval and INV-16115 was already paid.\n- No payments had already gone out from the operating account, so this didn't duplicate an earlier one.\n- The amount is under $10,000, so it didn't need controller approval.\n- I gave the wire a unique request ID (`pay-INV-75453-wire`) so that if the request were repeated, it would only go through once.", "type": "text"}]}]}